# GitHub Linguist — keep the repo's language bar about the server itself.
#
# This project is a C++ database server. The regression suite is ~626 KB of
# Python and the planning docs are ~800 KB of Markdown; on the `test` branch,
# which carries everything, that reports the repo as majority-Python. Markdown
# and JSON are already excluded by Linguist (prose / data), but the suite is
# not, so it is marked here.
#
# `linguist-vendored` excludes a path from the language statistics. Side effect
# worth knowing: GitHub also collapses those files by default in diffs.

scripts/**          linguist-vendored
docs/**             linguist-documentation
*.aof               linguist-generated
benchappend.aof     linguist-generated
